Task: Implement types and storage utilities

Summary: Created the core types layer (GameId, StickerData, Settings, AppStorage) and localStorage persistence utilities (load, save, earnSticker, hasSticker, getSettings, updateSettings). All 12 tests pass with 100% coverage. Also fixed two Phase 1 config issues: added globals:true to Vitest config (required for describe/it/beforeEach globals), and installed @vitest/coverage-v8 package (required for coverage reports).

Created files:
- src/types/index.ts (GameId type, StickerData/Settings/AppStorage interfaces)
- src/utils/storage.ts (6 exported functions with JSDoc, createDefaultStorage helper)

Modified files:
- vite.config.ts (added globals: true to test config)
- package.json (added @vitest/coverage-v8 dev dependency)
- pnpm-lock.yaml (lockfile update)
- conductor/tech-stack.md (synced dev dependencies list with actual package.json)

Config fixes: globals:true was missing from Vitest config (tsconfig had vitest/globals types but runtime globals weren't enabled). @vitest/coverage-v8 was not installed despite coverage provider being set to v8 in vite.config.ts. Both were Phase 1 oversights.

Pre-existing issue noted: src/main.ts has a TS2882 error for CSS side-effect import (import './styles/style.css'). This is a Phase 1 issue not related to this task. Needs a vite-env.d.ts type declaration.

Why: The storage layer manages sticker collection and audio settings persistence via localStorage (key: abby-little-lab:v1). This is the foundation for cross-game systems (sticker awards, settings toggles) used by all 6 mini-games.
